        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>PDQ American Eagle Parallel Arm Bracket for American Eagle 3100</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFits <a href=\"/products/light-commercial-surface-mount-closer-pdq-3100-bcpa\"><b>American Eagle 3100</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/light-commercial-ada-compliant-surface-mount-closer-pdq-3101-bcpa\"><b>American Eagle 3101</b></a>  Door Closers. Can be used with an door closer arm with  a 3/8\" diameter pivot joint.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/friction-hold-open-arm-parallel-arm-bracket-for-american-eagle-3100-pdq-999022\"><b>Hold Open Arm Parallel  Bracket</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>For use with <a href=\"/products/standard-duty-arm-for-american-eagle-3100-series-pdq-319003\">Standard Door Closer Arms</a> Only</b>. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for American Eagle Parallel Arm Bracket\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Max Width: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pivot Pin Diameter: 3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in Aluminum or Dark Bronze finish.\r\n</p>",
